{"id":474,"date":"2025-07-27T17:35:11","date_gmt":"2025-07-27T17:35:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/?p=474"},"modified":"2025-07-27T19:14:27","modified_gmt":"2025-07-27T19:14:27","slug":"moving-rasa","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/2025\/07\/27\/moving-rasa\/","title":{"rendered":"Moving Rasa"},"content":{"rendered":"<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"177\"><strong data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"177\">Moving Rasa \u2013 Creative &amp; Digital Strategy<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"179\" data-end=\"474\"><strong data-start=\"179\" data-end=\"199\">Client Overview:<\/strong><br data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"202\" \/>Moving Rasa is a movement-based healing organization focused on supporting marginalized communities\u2014particularly Southeast Asian, Pacific Islander, Black, Indigenous, and differently abled individuals\u2014through programs that center empowerment, wellness, and community care.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"638\"><strong data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"494\">Scope of Work:<\/strong><br data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"497\" \/>As a creative consultant for Moving Rasa, I provided comprehensive support across digital strategy, content creation, and merchandise design:<\/p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"1440\">\n<li data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"910\">\n<p data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"910\"><strong data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"670\">Social Media Management:<\/strong><br data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"673\" \/>Researched culturally relevant topics and aligned messaging with community values. Designed and scheduled posts, edited video content, wrote engaging captions, and published across platforms to build visibility and audience engagement.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"1151\">\n<p data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"1151\"><strong data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"944\">Digital Newsletter Design:<\/strong><br data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"947\" \/>Designed and managed bi-weekly email campaigns. This included layout design, content planning, and scheduling, ensuring each message reflected the organization&#8217;s tone, mission, and upcoming programming.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1440\">\n<p data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1440\"><strong data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1191\">Merchandise Design &amp; Production:<\/strong><br data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1194\" \/>Led the concept-to-production process for branded merchandise. Conducted trend research, sourced materials, collaborated with vendors, and selected color palettes and garment styles that reflected Moving Rasa\u2019s identity and community aesthetic.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1669\"><strong data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1453\">Impact:<\/strong><br data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1456\" \/>This work supported Moving Rasa\u2019s mission by amplifying their voice online, deepening community connection, and translating their values into tangible visual storytelling\u2014both on screen and through wearable goods.&#8221;<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1669\">\n<hr \/>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1669\">Social Media Carousel<\/h6>\n<p data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1669\"><a href=\"http:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Artboard-7@2x-100.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"475\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/2025\/07\/27\/moving-rasa\/artboard-72x-100\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Artboard-7@2x-100.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1698,826\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-title=\"Artboard 7@2x-100\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/wo